    Short single-column patch section with new figures; restyled figures 4-12
    
    - Section 5.7 (single-column patch) replaced by a short section: the
      motivation for the smaller patch, the paper's four robustness sweeps
      re-run for both codes with the star and the single-column patch
      (new figures Image_restyled/single_column_{linear,nonlinear}), and the
      result: the single column converges wherever the star does and is as
      parameter-robust at the time step of the sweeps; it needs two to three
      times the iterations in the grad-div-dominated nonlinear regime. The
      old fig. 14 and the two single-column tables are removed.
    - Figures 4-12 now use the restyled drop-in versions in Image_restyled/
      (same data, same file names).
    - Captions of figs. 6, 10, 11, 12 follow the restyled legends; the
      reversed C_1 intervals of figs. 11-12 are replaced by the seven values;
      missing word in Section 5.1.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

